| Global Id | Track | Driver Type/Pin | Constraint | Clock Loads | Non-Clock Loads | FF | Memory LUTs | RAMB | DSP | GT | MMCM | PLL | Hard IP | Net           |
+-----------+-------+-----------------+------------+-------------+-----------------+----+-------------+------+-----+----+------+-----+---------+---------------+
| g0        | n/a   | BUFG/O          | None       |           2 |               0 |  2 |           0 |    0 |   0 |  0 |    0 |   0 |       0 | clk_IBUF_BUFG |
